# Force LF line endings on checkout regardless of the checking-out
# machine's own core.autocrlf - without this, a Windows checkout's default
# CRLF conversion makes committed text files byte-different from what any
# in-memory-generated string comparison (e.g. build-skill.js --check)
# expects, even though the actual content is identical. Confirmed for real:
# this is exactly what broke `npm run build:skill:check` the first time CI
# ever ran on windows-latest.
* text=auto eol=lf
